{"ID":"20240118151347-6nlbbng","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151347-6nlbbng","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151347-6nlbbng\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151347-4bsdv34\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240119173037-9l0emes\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240119173037-9l0emes\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:89,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:89\u0026#125;","title":"047奄闾子","type":"doc","updated":"20240126170533"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151347-4bsdv34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151347-4bsdv34","updated":"20240119173009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦微寒，主五脏瘀血，腹中水气，胪张留热，风寒湿痹，身体诸痛，久服轻身延年不老。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119173014-aw4q52e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173014-aw4q52e"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，状似蒿艾，其茎可以盖覆奄闾，故名。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119173017-96nhaa4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173017-96nhaa4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦性微寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119173016-t8ccv31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173016-t8ccv31"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】奄闾主五脏瘀血，风寒湿痹，身体诸痛，明目益气消食。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119173018-bcjxh2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173018-bcjxh2g"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗心下坚，隔中寒热，周痹，妇人月水不通。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119173020-44x51lc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173020-44x51lc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】益气，主男子阴痿不起，治心腹胀满。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119173021-5ennaqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173021-5ennaqg"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】腰脚重痛，膀胱痛，及骨节烦痛，不下食。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119173023-3734fto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173023-3734fto"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119173024-9a734iv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173024-9a734iv"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】用之治扑打损伤效，罕有用于调理者。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119173009-8qk3qy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173009-8qk3qy8"}},{"ID":"20240119173025-kgtm9zh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173025-kgtm9zh"}},{"ID":"20240119173025-psajhni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173025-psajhni","updated":"20240126170435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第47，叫做奄闾子，奄闾子这个药，是中医伤科在用的。这个药主活血化瘀，内脏的五脏出血撞伤打伤，这个是苦味的药，药很苦哦，主活血化瘀，伤科用药。那所有的痛都可以使用，伤科的药在用的时候诸位内服跟外服都可以，你给它泡在药酒里面，内服也可以。"}]},{"ID":"20240119173030-hwu2bi5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173030-hwu2bi5","updated":"20240126170452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个性苦，苦味的主泄下，能够坚，让他虚弱的地方坚硬起来。同时呢这个苦味能够入心脏嘛，所以能够活血化瘀。所以《别录》说疗心下坚。治跌打损伤，一般病里面调理用的不多。"}]},{"ID":"20240119173037-9l0emes","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119173037-9l0emes","updated":"20240126170533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“老师，我怎么知道这个病人内有淤血，身上有瘀血？”很简单，你舌头伸出来我看看，舌头伸出来一看，哎！老师它上面生个黑痣——瘀血。有的时候黑黑的一粒粒小小的，就是瘀血。还有呢，脚痉骨小腿拉起来，一看从三阴交的地方一直到这个地机，我们不是有“三皇”吗，从地机三阴交这一段肌肤甲错、皮肤干干的，干脱屑下来。“老师，我就奇怪就这一段皮肤像蛇皮一样，常常褪皮下来，一块一块的。”就是腹部里面有瘀血，腹腔里面有瘀血。所以很多地方我们可以看到。那你如果说，病人也会陈述啊，有瘀血就会痛啊胸口里面痛都会"}]}]}